{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange rumor has been spreading in this quiet countryside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that if you walk alone at night,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a ghostly woman will speak to you\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAre you \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple survival horror set in a hilly town where you must escape from a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on running away\u2014there are no puzzles, item usage, or complex controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, try again, memorize the roads, and find your way to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes to over 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clicking on Ayumu\u2019s apartment mailbox and\u2026!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For details, please check the official STUDIO DYD website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance to actual persons, organizations, or places is purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2871820?t=1764301345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871820/43419f62fff96b1839a758afcf02262cf5cd97fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764301345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/